<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Apple estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Apple estimate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it lowered its fiscal first quarter earnings estimate on Apple Computer Inc to a loss of $0.53 a share from a loss of $0.05.</p>
<p>-- cited lower than expected revenue growth.</p>
<p>-- On Friday Apple said it expected to report an operating loss of as much as $150 million for it first quarter, ended in December.</p>
<p>-- Lehman maintained its outperform rating on the stock.</p>
</text>
